nty","/arc-plc/missouri/carroll-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. On the middle, August to September 2025 came in at 44% of normal, and March to April 2026 came in at 178%. Every grid had its driest year in 1956, and grid 23248 got 52% of normal that year.</p>"}
